'' A float stored into a narrow integer down every store path compiles to a
'' program. The source's header carries fbc-modern's output; tiko's build prints the
'' same. The runner cannot run the result, so this asserts the IR reaches clang and
'' links -- tests/mir/float-to-narrow-int.test asserts its shape.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/driver/src/float-to-narrow-int.bas -o tests/driver/floatnarrowint.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/floatnarrowint.exe
